MODULE: BeginLosesDurableIntent
TARGET: DurableMove
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: initiating a move loses its durable announcement at interruption
PERTURBS: Begin

--- FIND
        /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, map, version, redirect, owner, route, running, faults, overwritten>>
--- REPLACE
        /\ running' = FALSE
        /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, map, version, redirect, owner, route, faults, overwritten>>
--- END
